              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi wakati hinyo mudzi wa Tiro undayalwa kpwa muda wa miaka mirongo sabaa, sawa-sawa na muda wa umuri wa mfalume mmwenga. Ela muda uhu wa miaka mirongo sabaa ndiphosira, mudzi wa Tiro undakala dza hura wira wa malaya uambao:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.23.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.23.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
