            "sid": "ISA 23:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bada ya iyo miaka mirongo sabaa, Mwenyezi Mlungu andaufufula mudzi wa Tiro. Bisharaze zindauya dza hipho mwandzo na kudziphahira pesa kpwa kudziguza kpwa falume zosi duniani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.23.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.23.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 23:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela higo maripho ga bisharaze gandatengbwa kpwa ajili ya Mwenyezi Mlungu. Tagandaikpwa kuikpwako hazina wala akiba, ela fwaida za bisharaze zindakala mali ya hinyo ahumikao mbere za Mwenyezi Mlungu, aphahe kurya kumvuna na avwaleto.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.23.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.23.18"
            ]
          }
        }
